                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As per http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/, this is invalid:<br/>
<br/>
3.3.3 Constraints on XML Representations of Element Declarations<br/>
  Schema Representation Constraint: Element Declaration Representation<br/>
<br/>
2.2 If ref is present, then all of &lt;complexType&gt;, &lt;simpleType&gt;, &lt;key&gt;, &lt;keyref&gt;, &lt;unique&gt;, nillable, default, fixed, form, block and type must be absent, i.e. only minOccurs, maxOccurs, id are allowed in addition to ref, along with &lt;annotation&gt;.
  </td>
