                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-2911                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The DelegatingInputStream instance created in AbstractHTTPDestination uses the passed Message instance to cache HttpServletRequest inputs. However in ChainInitiationObserver::onMessage a new SoapMessage is created by copying the existing request message contents, so when the DelegatingInputStream caching is triggered, the input data is saved in wrong message instance.<br/>
<br/>
The result is CXF-2911 bug is still valid.
