                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Most of this issues is about refactorings to improve readability of the code.<br/>
There is one functional change though:<br/>
In AbstractXACMLAuthorizingInterceptor.authorize the handling of the response does not look into the resources anymore. The decision should be enough.<br/>
<br/>
In a second step I introduce an class XACMLAuthorizingInterceptor that simply needs to be given a PolicyDecisionPoint to do its work. As the abstract class is then not necessary anymore I deprecate it.<br/>

