                <tr id="issuerow12657579" rel="12657579" data-issuekey="CXF-5125" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5125" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5125">CXF-5125</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Inconsistent namespace/element name qualification in SoapBody in normal vs. fault return message.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Incomplete
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dusan Slivka
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dusan Slivka
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Jul/13 10:03 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:37 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Mar/17 19:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      CXF 2.7.2
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is my standard SOAP response message:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ns2:getPoolReportResponse xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://admin/&quot;&gt;<br/>
         &lt;owner&gt;OWNER&lt;/owner&gt;<br/>
         &lt;recordsCnt&gt;0&lt;/recordsCnt&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/ns2:getPoolReportResponse&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and this is fault message generated with the same system:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
         &lt;faultcode&gt;soap:Server&lt;/faultcode&gt;<br/>
         &lt;faultstring&gt;message--&lt;/faultstring&gt;<br/>
         &lt;detail&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ns1:permissionDeniedException xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://admin/&quot;&gt;<br/>
               &lt;role xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://admin/&quot;&gt;user..&lt;/role&gt;<br/>
               &lt;domain xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://admin/&quot;&gt;role...&lt;/domain&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/ns1:permissionDeniedException&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/detail&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/soap:Fault&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Why does the fault define namespace ns2 and why it is assigned to all elements?
  </td>
