</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Eclipselink Moxy has a bunch of extra annotations and such which can provide a more complete mapping for XML.   Also, it&#39;s the default JAXB implementation in WebLogic now.   We should try and detect Moxy and provide appropriate behavior (for things like the namespace/prefix maps).<br/>

  </td>
