And the environment details are as below:<br/>
<br/>
web service deployed in tomcat and client is spring bean which is run as a  java standalone program &amp; details are as below:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;http:conduit name=&quot;*.http-conduit&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;http:tlsClientParameters secureSocketProtocol=&quot;SSL&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;sec:trustManagers&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sec:keyStore resource=&quot;key-store.jks&quot; password=&quot;password&quot; type=&quot;JKS&quot;/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/sec:trustManagers&gt;<br/>
            &lt;sec:cipherSuitesFilter&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sec:include&gt;.*_EXPORT_.*&lt;/sec:include&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sec:include&gt;.*_EXPORT1024_.*&lt;/sec:include&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sec:include&gt;.*_WITH_3DES_.*&lt;/sec:include&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sec:include&gt;.*_WITH_DES_.*&lt;/sec:include&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sec:include&gt;.*_WITH_AES_.*&lt;/sec:include&gt;<br/>
