                                            <td class="description">      When separating a search with &#39;;&#39; (to indicate AND), SearchContext.getCondition(SearchBean.class) returns null.<br/>
<br/>
This works:<br/>
<br/>
?_s=name==CXF<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
This doesn&#39;t:<br/>
<br/>
?_s=name==CXF;version=1
