                                            <td class="description">      A couple of cases have been reported recently where a single equals operator &#39;=&#39; which is not valid in FIQL is causing the parser to fail parsing the expression. It may make sense to support single &#39;=&#39; operators to minimize the possible confusion and simplify the expressions a little bit
