</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5146                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      if we have <br/>
{code:java}<br/>
public interface Service&lt;T&gt; {<br/>
<br/>
  T get();<br/>
<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Then we should be able to have<br/>
<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
Service&lt;Book&gt; service = JAXRSClientFactory.create(address, new GenericType&lt;Service&lt;Book&gt;&gt;());<br/>
<br/>
service.get();<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This will allow the proxy pass on the correct type info to the providers
  </td>
