                                            <td class="description">      errors happend when call a method that return string include special character like &quot;rdquo;&quot;,the errors below:<br/>
<br/>
&amp;rdquo;org.apache.cxf.interceptor.Fault: Unmarshalling Error: Unexpected character &#39;&lt;&#39; (code 60); expected a semi-colon after the reference for entity &#39;ld...&#39;<br/>
 at [row,col {unknown-source}]: [2,630] <br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxb.JAXBEncoderDecoder.unmarshall(JAXBEncoderDecoder.java:866)<br/>
