</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, the PEP only sends the &quot;\{operationNamespace\}operationName&quot; to the PDP for authorization. This does not allow the PDP to perform authorization by service. <br/>
<br/>
This will be changed to the following instead:<br/>
<br/>
&quot;\{serviceNamespace}serviceName\#\{operationNamespace\}operationName&quot;, which will be truncated to &quot;\{serviceNamespace}serviceName\#operationName&quot; for the case that the serviceNamespace == operationNamespace.
  </td>
