                <tr id="issuerow12660867" rel="12660867" data-issuekey="CXF-5169" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5169" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5169">CXF-5169</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                the schema-validation-enabled property doesn&#39;t work for OUT message validation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xilai Dai
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xilai Dai
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Jul/13 06:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Nov/13 02:56 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/13 19:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.10,                     2.7.7,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        GERONIMO-6509                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      With this configuration: <br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint ...&gt;<br/>
......<br/>
  &lt;jaxws:properties&gt;<br/>
      &lt;entry key=&quot;schema-validation-enabled&quot; value=&quot;true&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/jaxws:properties&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
then, the schema validation for Request(IN) message works well, but it doesn&#39;t take any effect for Response(OUT) message.<br/>
<br/>
the schema (from WSDL) piece example which I used is:<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;xsd:element name=&quot;DemoServiceOperationResponse&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
            &lt;xsd:element name=&quot;out&quot;&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;xsd:simpleType&gt;<br/>
                       &lt;xsd:restriction base=&quot;xsd:string&quot;&gt;<br/>
                       &lt;xsd:minLength value=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;/xsd:minLength&gt;<br/>
                       &lt;xsd:maxLength value=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;/xsd:maxLength&gt;<br/>
                       &lt;/xsd:restriction&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/xsd:simpleType&gt;<br/>
             &lt;/xsd:element&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xsd:element&gt;<br/>
{code}
  </td>
