<br/>
<br/>
This is caused by a construct in our code like the following:<br/>
@XmlElement(name=&quot;orderItems&quot;,required=true)<br/>
protected OrderItemsDTO&lt;? extends OrderItemDTO&lt;? extends OrderItem&gt;&gt; orderItems;<br/>
<br/>
The problem seems to be that the class needs to recurse again in InjectionUtils#getActualType(). When I set a breakpoint and made the call manually, the problem did not occur.<br/>

