                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As the user&#39;s login name my change over time it might be a good idea to assign a unique, non-changing user id. To reflect this within the auth module the class USerSubject needs an additional field.<br/>
<br/>
The OAuthContextUtils the may resolve the user&#39;s id.<br/>
<br/>
A patch implementing this improvement is attached.
