                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If an empty list of alternateAddresses is specified in SequentialStrategy this causes a NullPointerException in FailoverTargetSelector.<br/>
<br/>
As the exception is thrown the key is never removed from the inProgress map resulting in a memory leak.<br/>
<br/>
The stack trace for the exception is below:<br/>
<br/>
