                <tr id="issuerow12662428" rel="12662428" data-issuekey="CXF-5187" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5187" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5187">CXF-5187</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Use a negative value of maxRetries to indicate unbounded retries in WS-RM
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Aug/13 17:03 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Sep/13 18:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Aug/13 13:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.10,                     2.7.7,                     3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, the value of 0, which is by default, and negative values can indicate unbounded retries.<br/>
<br/>
It is more logical to use only a negative value of maxRetries to indicate an unbounded number of retries in WS-RM (e.g., in its retransmissions). In that way, a non-negative value can correctly represent the number of allowed retries.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
