                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is related to CXF-2609&#39;s fix for EndpointReferenceUtils:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
if (ent.getKey().endsWith(namespaceURI)) {<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
I believe this should be:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
if (ent.getKey().endsWith(&quot;:&quot; + namespaceURI)) {<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
Otherwise this can return the wrong schema entry in the case of 2 schema where one&#39;s namespace is a prefix + the other namespace.
  </td>
