                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I add:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
 &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;groupId&gt;org.opensaml&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;artifactId&gt;opensaml&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;version&gt;2.6.0&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;optional&gt;true&lt;/optional&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;exclusions&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;exclusion&gt;<br/>
                                        &lt;groupId&gt;xml-apis&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                                        &lt;artifactId&gt;xml-apis&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
