                                            <td class="description">      When using Spring AOP @Context injection using fields is not working. I found some threads suggesting the use of interfaces which is working. Now I wanted to add the interface to my superclass to avoid implementing it in every REST class. The &quot;findContextSetterMethods&quot; doesn&#39;t check superclasses. I attached a possible patch but I am not sure about side effects.
