                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      See http://nurkiewicz.blogspot.no/2011/05/enabling-load-balancing-and-failover-in.html for elaboration.<br/>
<br/>
It would be neat if I was able to toggle pretty printing in the loggingFeature configuration with:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;cxf:bus&gt;<br/>
    &lt;cxf:features&gt;<br/>
        &lt;cxf:logging prettyPrint=&quot;${cxf.logging.prettyPrint}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/cxf:features&gt;<br/>
&lt;/cxf:bus&gt; <br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
instead of having to configure the beans and put them in place for each chain.
