  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Deployed web service employing the xslt feature described at http://cxf.apache.org/docs/xslt-feature.html. Service operates normally. However, when attempting to resolve the wsdl at https://service.url.tld/services/ServicePort?wsdl, the browser returns the following response:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;soap:Fault&gt;&lt;faultcode&gt;soap:Server&lt;/faultcode&gt;&lt;faultstring&gt;XSL transformation error: javax.xml.transform.TransformerException: com.sun.org.apache.xml.internal.utils.WrappedRuntimeException: Premature end of file..&lt;/faultstring&gt;&lt;/soap:Fault&gt;&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Logs shows the following:<br/>
2013-08-23/16:51:18 [WARN ] org.apache.cxf.phase.PhaseInterceptorChain - Interceptor for {http://greenskycredit.com/wsdl/Five9API}Five9API has thrown exception, unwinding now<br/>
