                <tr id="issuerow12666156" rel="12666156" data-issuekey="CXF-5243" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5243" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5243">CXF-5243</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAX-RS 2.0 ContainerRequestContext#getEntityStream() doesn&#39;t return request payload
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dmitry Treskunov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dmitry Treskunov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Aug/13 16:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Sep/13 18:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Aug/13 12:35 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.7,                     3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Implementation of JAX-RS 2.0 ContainerRequestContext#getEntityStream() doesn&#39;t return request body.<br/>
<br/>
Probably, the reason is that this implementation tries to extract body using call m.get(InputStream.class), but should use call m.getContent(InputStream.class).<br/>
<br/>
I saw, that it was fixed in trunk several month ago, but it is not in any release now.
  </td>
