    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5251" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5251">CXF-5251</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Implement more stringent requirements on allowing OnBehalfOf/ActAs in the STS
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Sep/13 16:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Sep/13 18:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Sep/13 15:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.10,                     2.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        STS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This task is to implement more stringent requirements on allowing OnBehalfOf/ActAs in the STS. A new interface will be introduced to determine whether or not is is allowed to issue a new token OnBehalfOf/ActAs some other token. To support either of these things in the STS it will be necessary to plug in a TokenDelegationHandler implementation to handle a specific token. Implementations are provided in the STS for SAML Tokens and UsernameTokens.
  </td>
