                <tr id="issuerow12667520" rel="12667520" data-issuekey="CXF-5258" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5258" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5258">CXF-5258</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Return type list of a typed type, e.g. List&lt;Type&lt;Typee&gt;&gt;, leads to ClassCastException
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Kai Stapel
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Kai Stapel
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Sep/13 06:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Nov/13 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Nov/13 20:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.8,                     2.6.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you use a list of a typed type as the return type (yes, a lot of types ;) ) in a CXF service you will get a<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.ClassCastException: java.util.ArrayList cannot be cast to some.class.Name<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
exception.<br/>
<br/>
I attached a small example showing the problem for CXF 2.7.6.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m not quite sure if this really is a CXF JAXBDatabinding problem or if it is caused by something else.<br/>

  </td>
