                <tr id="issuerow12668965" rel="12668965" data-issuekey="CXF-5283" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5283" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5283">CXF-5283</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                sts: NoClassDefFoundError in LoggerListener
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Sep/13 08:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Sep/13 18:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Sep/13 13:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.7,                     3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        STS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      LoggerListener has an optional dependency to the servlet spec 3.0.<br/>
This spec defines javax.servlet.http in version 2.6.<br/>
So the import in sts-core uses version [2.6,3).<br/>
<br/>
Karaf 2.3.x only offers the servlet spec 2.5 jar which exports the package as 2.5.<br/>
<br/>
So the optional import is not found and so we get the error.<br/>
<br/>
Inside LoggerListener we only check for NPE and for Exception. As this is an Error it completely breaks the execution.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
