                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java.lang.UnsupportedOperationException in org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.model.wadl.WadlGenerator
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
