                                            <td class="description">      Cause:<br/>
======<br/>
WadlGenerator.getLocationsMap() (line: 1405) returns an immutable map:<br/>
 return Collections.emptyMap();<br/>
<br/>
.putAll(..) is then called on this map in WadlGenerator.StringSchemaWriter.StringSchemaWriter(...) (line: 1394):<br/>
locs.putAll(getLocationsMap(source, &quot;include&quot;, links, ui));<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Proposed Solution:<br/>
==================<br/>
In WadlGenerator.getLocationsMap() (line: 1405):<br/>
return new HashMap&lt;String, String&gt;() ;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
