                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5290" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5290">CXF-5290</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                jaxb&#39;s databinding to support an option to not include specific namespace declarations when marshaling
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Sep/13 15:51 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Nov/13 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Sep/13 20:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core,                     JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, JAXB&#39;s databinding supports the namespace prefix mapping option to use specific namespace prefixes at serialization but there is no option to not include specific namespace declarations in the serialized message (e.g., when an object is serialized into an output stream and when those namespaces are already declared before).<br/>
<br/>
Basically, we can provide<br/>
<br/>
&lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxb.JAXBDataBinding&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;!-- the available option to control the namespace prefix mapping --&gt;<br/>
  &lt;property name=&quot;namespaceMap&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;map&gt;<br/>
      &lt;entry key=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/hello_world_soap_http/types&quot; value=&quot;x&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/map&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/property&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;!-- a new option to specify the out-of-band namespace declarations --&gt;<br/>
  &lt;property name=&quot;contextualNamespaceMap&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;map&gt;<br/>
      &lt;entry key=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/hello_world_soap_http/types&quot; value=&quot;x&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/map&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/property&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This limitation was discussed in<br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/Issue-in-Prefix-management-of-namespace-in-cxf-2-5-10-td5733766.html<br/>

  </td>
