                                            <td class="description">      In org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.provider.JAXBElementProvider&lt;T&gt; in the method ,<br/>
 <br/>
protected void marshal(Object obj, Class&lt;?&gt; cls, Type genericType, <br/>
                           String enc, OutputStream os, MediaType mt,<br/>
                           Annotation[] anns) throws Exception {} calls <br/>
<br/>
createMarshaller(..)-&gt;getJAXBContext(objClazz, genericType). In the getJAXBContext() method the getPackageContext(..) and getClassContext(..) simply ignores the genericType info as a result of which the JAXBContext is incomplete resulting in exceptions like , class java.util.ArrayList nor any of its super class is known to this context., info=javax.xml.bind.JAXBException<br/>
<br/>

