                <tr id="issuerow12670904" rel="12670904" data-issuekey="CXF-5306" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5306" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5306">CXF-5306</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Soap body in header
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            matej
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            matej
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Sep/13 11:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Nov/13 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Oct/13 21:22 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.8,                     2.6.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am using apache-cxf-2.7.6. I generated soap client from wsdl. In Java code I set values for the request object and send request. Soap xml request is not valid. In the header is request body and soap:body is empty. This is generated xml which is not valid:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:Header&gt;<br/>
