</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5370                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently LoggerListener can be set to a fixed log level for all messages it creates. <br/>
<br/>
This is not very helpful as for example a successful and failed authentication should not be at the same log level.<br/>
<br/>
So instead of a setable log level I would like to have different log levels per event type. To not make configuration more complicated I would then remove the log level setter.<br/>

  </td>
