                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The source file org.apache.cxf.jaxws.handler.logical.LogicalMessageImpl.java uses DOMUtils from wsdl4j.jar. wsdl4j.jar is one implementation of the JWSDL specification and can be replaced by another implementation. This direct reference makes it impossible to switch implementation.<br/>

