                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      cxf-wsn doesn&#39;t register its bus as a service. This could be a problem if someone would like to add a feature to this bus as OSGIBusListener only add features to bus that are registered as a OSGi-Service.<br/>
<br/>
A patch based on the current trunk for this issue is attached (Apache License, Version 2.0).
