                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java.lang.NoSuchMethodError after the upgrade of CXF version 2.6.2
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Test</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
