                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m getting a NPE when using a contract-first WS endpoint whose wsdl contains:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsp:PolicyReference URI=&quot;#ForceMTOM&quot; wsdl:required=&quot;true&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Caused by: java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxws.support.JaxWsEndpointImpl.checkRespectBindingFeature(JaxWsEndpointImpl.java:267)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxws.support.JaxWsEndpointImpl.extractWsdlExtensibilities(JaxWsEndpointImpl.java:227)<br/>
