1) install and start karaf 3.0.0-SNAPSHOT<br/>
2) Checkout and compile https://github.com/cschneider/Karaf-Tutorial/tree/master/cxf/personservice<br/>
3) Install service<br/>
feature:repo-add cxf 2.7.7<br/>
feature:install cxf-jaxws cxf-jaxrs<br/>
install -s mvn:net.lr.tutorial.karaf.cxf.personservice/personservice-model/1.0-SNAPSHOT<br/>
install -s mvn:net.lr.tutorial.karaf.cxf.personservice/personservice-server/1.0-SNAPSHOT<br/>
<br/>
