                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We have a client side CXF bus with in/out interceptors and , a server side bus with in/out interceptors. If the same service is being used for both client side and server side invocations , the 2 buses end up in the same spring application context. As a result of this one CXF bus is over-written and the interceptor chain for that CXF bus is lost.So how do we manage multiple CXF buses in the same application context without the 2 buses interfering with each other.
