                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      to make RESTful service support swagger, we need some configuration like the change here[1], as most configuration here could be fixed, so if we can introduce a SwaggerFeature which just put all general default  value so that we can enable swagger just by<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;jaxrs:features&gt;<br/>
            &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.swagger.SwaggerFeature&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/jaxrs:features&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
[1]http://svn.apache.org/viewvc/servicemix/smx5/trunk/examples/cxf/cxf-jaxrs-blueprint/src/main/resources/OSGI-INF/blueprint/blueprint.xml?r1=1537442&amp;r2=1537441&amp;pathrev=1537442
  </td>
