<br/>
com.ibm.ws.webcontainer.servlet.ServletWrapper service Uncaught service() exception thrown by servlet appServlet: java.lang.NoSuchMethodError: javax/ws/rs/core/Response.getHeaders()Ljavax/ws/rs/core/MultivaluedMap;<br/>
