</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Usage of BeanDefinitionBuilder.addConstructorArg is causing issues with Spring IDE 3.4.0.201310051539-RELEASE. The afforementioned release of Spring IDE appears to be utilizing the upcoming Spring 4 libraries which have removed the signature addConstructorArg.  The attached patch (for the 2.7.x-fixes branch) updates this to utilize addConstructorArgValue()<br/>
<br/>
See stack trace below.<br/>
<br/>
This has already been fixed in upstream trunk.<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
