                <tr id="issuerow12680130" rel="12680130" data-issuekey="CXF-5404" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5404" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5404">CXF-5404</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NPE in AtomPojoProvider when no content (or content is empty)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dale Peakall
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dale Peakall
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Nov/13 08:23 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Nov/13 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Nov/13 12:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0-milestone1,                     2.7.9            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using the AtomPojoProvider with JAX-RS - the library bombs with an NPE (embedded in a ClientErrorException) if using JAXB annotated content objects - but no content is provided in the entry.  It also NPE&#39;s if the content element is present but contains no XML (although this is a slightly dubious Atom document at this point).<br/>
<br/>
Returning &quot;null&quot; would be a much better result in this case.
