                <tr id="issuerow12680342" rel="12680342" data-issuekey="CXF-5409" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5409" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5409">CXF-5409</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make response code be included in logging for LocalTransport
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Nov/13 18:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Nov/13 13:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.12,                     2.7.9,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is about including the status code in the logging when LocalTransp[ort is used. Currently, the status code is only included in some cases (e.g., jaxrs) and not for soap based scenarios. Including the status code analogue to the http status code that is included under HTTPTransport would be helpful in some cases. <br/>
<br/>
Refer to comments on CXF-5391 for this discussion.<br/>

  </td>
