                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5415                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      WebClient gets its QName syntesized as {RequestURI}WebClient, where Request URI is supposed to represent a base endpoint address, which uniquely identifies a given service target.<br/>
When WebClient is initialized from URI already containing a query, this query makes its way into QName which is really wrong. The query will be displayed as part of the operation if needed (ex in JMX, etc)<br/>
<br/>
 
  </td>
