                <tr id="issuerow12681157" rel="12681157" data-issuekey="CXF-5421" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5421" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5421">CXF-5421</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Servlet dependency in OAuth2 pom.xml should be with scope &quot;provided&quot;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christophe Levesque
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christophe Levesque
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Nov/13 23:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Nov/13 17:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/13 13:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.9,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS,                     JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      From cxf-rt-rs-security-oauth2&#39;s pom.xml:<br/>
<br/>
       &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
            &lt;groupId&gt;${cxf.servlet-api.group}&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifactId&gt;${cxf.servlet-api.artifact}&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;version&gt;${cxf.servlet-api.version}&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This should have a &lt;scope&gt;provided&lt;/scope&gt; otherwise the servlet JAR will be pulled in as a transitive dependency. It may conflict with the container&#39;s own servlet and throw exceptions like:<br/>
<br/>
Caused by: java.lang.ClassCastException: org.springframework.web.SpringServletContainerInitializer cannot be cast to javax.servlet.ServletContainerInitializer<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.startup.ContextConfig.getServletContainerInitializer(ContextConfig.java:1670)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.startup.ContextConfig.getServletContainerInitializers(ContextConfig.java:1652)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.startup.ContextConfig.processServletContainerInitializers(ContextConfig.java:1562)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.startup.ContextConfig.webConfig(ContextConfig.java:1270)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.startup.ContextConfig.configureStart(ContextConfig.java:878)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.startup.ContextConfig.lifecycleEvent(ContextConfig.java:376)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.util.LifecycleSupport.fireLifecycleEvent(LifecycleSupport.java:119)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.util.LifecycleBase.fireLifecycleEvent(LifecycleBase.java:90)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.core.StandardContext.startInternal(StandardContext.java:5322)<br/>
	at org.apache.catalina.util.LifecycleBase.start(LifecycleBase.java:150)<br/>
	... 6 more<br/>

  </td>
