</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java SE 1.7 <br/>
RS services exposed through embedded Jetty using cxf-rt-transports-http-jetty and cxf-rt-frontend-jaxrs
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve faced an unexpected behavior testing my app trying to deal with a POST request for a REST service where my message is empty string. In this case, when using a JAXRSClientFactory proxy i get java.lang.IllegalStateException: Already connected when i sent an empty byteArray ... the proxy method never gets called. This does not happens when i sent any content ... the proxy method gets called. I think it could be a bug.<br/>
<br/>
I have test case.<br/>
<br/>
Here is the full trace:<br/>
<br/>
