</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The generated build.xml uses:<br/>
        &lt;attribute name=&quot;jvmarg1&quot; default=&quot;-D&quot;/&gt;<br/>
which results in an empty system property key which Jetty does not like.  Causes a crash at startup.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

