                <tr id="issuerow12684083" rel="12684083" data-issuekey="CXF-5455" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5455" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5455">CXF-5455</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Generated servers only use first port impl
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Dec/13 18:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Dec/13 18:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.0-milestone1,                     2.7.8,                     2.6.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.12,                     2.7.9,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
When running wsdl2java with -all or -server with a wsdl that has a single service, but multiple ports, it will generate an &quot;Impl&quot; for each port which has the proper annotations.  However, the generated servers all use the &quot;first&quot; Impl and thus only the first port will get started.<br/>

