                <tr id="issuerow12684104" rel="12684104" data-issuekey="CXF-5456" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5456" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5456">CXF-5456</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Generated &quot;Impls&quot; should be based off the service/port, not portType
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Dec/13 20:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Dec/13 18:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The generated impls have the service name and port name burned into the @WebService annotation.  Thus, they should be named according to the port name, not the portType.  This would avoid the semi-unpredictable:<br/>
<br/>
FooPortTypeImpl.java<br/>
FooPortTypeImpl1.java<br/>
....<br/>
<br/>
and have things like:<br/>
FooSOAP11PortImpl.java<br/>
FooSOAP12PortImpl.java<br/>
....<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
