                                            <td class="description">      Imported xsd schemas from a locally copied xsd schema should be referenced using their &quot;original&quot; absolute schema location URLs and these &quot;original&quot; location URLs should be mapped to the locally available resource location in spring and blueprint.<br/>
<br/>
Currently, some imported schemas are directly referenced using their local relative resource location and this is interfering with the schema loading in spring.<br/>
<br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/issue-with-schema-loading-in-spring-td5737686.html<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
