                <tr id="issuerow12685194" rel="12685194" data-issuekey="CXF-5466" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5466" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5466">CXF-5466</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Dependency on javax.ws.rs-api
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Eugenio Lentini
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eugenio Lentini
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Dec/13 16:18 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Dec/13 17:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Dec/13 16:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.8            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
I am using Apache Olingo 1.1.0-SNAPSHOT which has a dependency on Apache CXF.<br/>
<br/>
As far as I have been told both Apache Olingo and CXF should be implemented against JSR-311 even if javax.ws.rs-api 2.0-M1 is defined. All the dependency on 2.0-M1 should have been removed but I have found this exception in Apache CXF 2.7.5, 2.7.7 and 2.7.8.<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.NoSuchMethodError: javax.ws.rs.core.Response.getHeaders()Ljavax/ws/rs/core/MultivaluedMap;<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.utils.JAXRSUtils.setMessageContentType(JAXRSUtils.java:1587)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.utils.JAXRSUtils.convertFaultToResponse(JAXRSUtils.java:1581)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.JAXRSInvoker.handleFault(JAXRSInvoker.java:308)<br/>
<br/>
It seems the code is not properly retro-compatible, could you please have a look?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks a lot for your attention.<br/>
Eugenio
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
