</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We are facing some problem using of httpasyncclient with async soap calls. Sometimes result are not returned. It occurs when configuration (org.apache.cxf.transport.http.async.usePolicy) is set with ASYNC_ONLY. This behaviour is not observed with the set to NEVER.<br/>
<br/>
I remark that the dependency version of httpasyncclient is 4.0-beta3. Ga version of httpasyncclient is not compatible with (there are some errors when it is used). It should be a good idea to update the version of httpasyncclient.
  </td>
