JDK 1.7 + Weblogic 12c
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Last Year Apache CXF 2.6.8 version was used to create Web Services for external applications. Platform was - JDK 1.5 + Weblogic 9.2 + AIX 5.3.<br/>
<br/>
Now, JDK version will be upgraded from 1.5 to 1.7 so new platform is JDK 1.7 + Weblogic 12c + AIX 7.1.<br/>
<br/>
Is Apache CXF 2.6.8 version is compatible and supported with JDK 1.7.<br/>
<br/>
Also, what is recommendation for CXF version to be used with JDK 1.7 or keep same CXF version with JDK 1.7 and later upgrade CXF version.
  </td>
