                                            <td class="description">      Hello,there<br/>
<br/>
If my computer connect with the internet, the cxf app will launch normally, But, If cut off the internet connection, the cxf app will launch failed and throw the socket exception, as the following, I don&#39;t know whether it is a bug or I miss any configuration. But, if I change the version of cxf to 2.4, It will be all fine. and before this, I try the version 2.7.8 and 3.0, but It doesn&#39;t work.Can anyone fix this problem or tell me how to configure?<br/>
<br/>
THX<br/>
