                <tr id="issuerow12689346" rel="12689346" data-issuekey="CXF-5496" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5496" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5496">CXF-5496</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                INBOUND_MESSAGE_ATTACHMENTS after soapMessage.writeTo(outputStream)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Frank Cornelis
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Frank Cornelis
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Jan/14 20:19 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Jan/14 19:24 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In a client I receive SOAP attachments.<br/>
Retrieving them within a SOAPHandler via<br/>
{code}<br/>
context.get(MessageContext.INBOUND_MESSAGE_ATTACHMENTS)<br/>
{code}<br/>
works, but if I first do (for logging purposes)<br/>
{code}<br/>
SOAPMessage soapMessage = context.getMessage();<br/>
ByteArrayOutputStream outputStream = new ByteArrayOutputStream();<br/>
soapMessage.writeTo(outputStream);<br/>
{code}<br/>
and afterwards try to retrieve the SOAP attachments via:<br/>
{code}<br/>
context.get(MessageContext.INBOUND_MESSAGE_ATTACHMENTS)<br/>
{code}<br/>
the DataHandler gives me an empty byte array.
  </td>
