                <tr id="issuerow12690824" rel="12690824" data-issuekey="CXF-5516" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5516" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5516">CXF-5516</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Decoupled endpoints are not compatible with @UseAsyncMethod annotation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrei Shakirin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Jan/14 17:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Jan/14 14:41 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.9,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In case of use decoupled endpoints in combination with @UseAsyncMethod annotation, code in AbstractJAXWSMethodInvoker tries to suspend transport continuation.<br/>
It causes &quot;java.lang.IllegalStateException: IDLE,initial&quot; exception and doesn&#39;t make sense, because partial response is already sent to the client and new processing thread is started. Full response will be sent in separate transport connection.
  </td>
