                <tr id="issuerow12690862" rel="12690862" data-issuekey="CXF-5517" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5517" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5517">CXF-5517</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Incorrect check for VOID type
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Valentin Mayamsin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Valentin Mayamsin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Jan/14 19:35 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Feb/14 14:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0-milestone2,                     2.6.13,                     2.7.10            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There are multiple occurrences in CXF code base for both server and client side which incorrectly deals with VOID return type. For example: <br/>
<br/>
method.getReturnType() == Void.class <br/>
<br/>
This fails in case of primitive VOID: <br/>
<br/>
method.getReturnType() =&gt; void.class <br/>
<br/>
The correct way of checking for VOID is: <br/>
<br/>
method.getReturnType().equals(Void.TYPE)<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    void</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060">    Unknown
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="31/Jan/14 15:15"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2014-01-31T15:15:06+0000">31/Jan/14 3:15 PM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    3 years, 25 weeks ago

                        </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312320"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310420">      369601
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312321"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312120">
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312121"><span class="sla-agent-restricted">Restricted to agents</span>
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312328"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312329"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312923"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312326"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312920"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312327"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312921"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312720"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312324"></td>
