                                            <td class="description">      Using: cxf-tr-ws-security-2.7.8<br/>
<br/>
The code in org.apache.cxf.ws.security.trust.AbstractSTSClient<br/>
that handles OnBehalfOf as a string requires a fully compliant XML<br/>
stmt like this,<br/>
    &quot;&lt;wst:OnBehalfOf xmlns:wst=\&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512\&quot;&gt;eve&lt;/wst:OnBehalfOf&gt;&quot;<br/>
<br/>
807   if (isString) {<br/>
