                <tr id="issuerow12691449" rel="12691449" data-issuekey="CXF-5528" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5528" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5528">CXF-5528</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF Blueprint resource classes should have a more simple definition
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Heath Kesler
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Heath Kesler
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Jan/14 19:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:51 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Jan/14 21:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.8            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.9,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When defining serviceBeans in the blueprint xml file, we first have to define the bean then reference that bean from the serviceBean definition.  It would be nice to have a short cut that allowed us to just define the class name in the rsServer xml.  Something like <br/>
<br/>
    &lt;jaxrs:server id=&quot;karafStringService&quot; address=&quot;/karaf&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;jaxrs:resourceClasses&gt;<br/>
            &lt;class name=&quot;com.example.test.cxf.StringRestServiceImpl&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/jaxrs:resourceClasses&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/jaxrs:server&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I will be submitting a patch shortly with an associated test.  I look forward to feedback.  <br/>

  </td>
