                <tr id="issuerow12692013" rel="12692013" data-issuekey="CXF-5530" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5530" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5530">CXF-5530</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Wrong error code for non existing client&#39;s
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tomasz Kędziora
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tomasz Kędziora
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Jan/14 11:26 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Jan/14 11:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.0-milestone1,                     2.7.8,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently when I use non existing client_id on call I get response:<br/>
<br/>
Response Code: 400<br/>
{code}<br/>
{<br/>
  &quot;error&quot;: &quot;invalid_request&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;error_description&quot;: &quot;Client ID is invalid&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;error_uri&quot;: null<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
But by RFC it should be returned error=*invalid_client*<br/>
http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6749#section-5.2<br/>
<br/>
Error is generated in that method:<br/>
org.apache.cxf.rs.security.oauth2.services.AccessTokenService.getClient(String)
  </td>
