                <tr id="issuerow12693364" rel="12693364" data-issuekey="CXF-5543" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5543" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5543">CXF-5543</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make jms transport independent from spring jms
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Feb/14 15:03 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:51 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Apr/14 08:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.0-milestone1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF should not depend on the spring framework. Most of the cxf modules are already independent.<br/>
<br/>
The jms transport currently depends on spring jms because it uses the spring abstractions JMSTemplate, DestinationResolver and MessageListenerContainer.<br/>
<br/>
I will refactor the jms transport to make it independent from spring jms.<br/>
As this is targeted for a major version I will also try to clean up the configuration and behaviour to make it simpler.
  </td>
