                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      i have a webservice which is synchronous. i want to make a asynchronous client request using dispatch api. i tried both polling and callback methods but in both cases i need to generate stubs and create a async handler and pass it.<br/>
<br/>
but my requirement is to call the web service asynchronously with out generating stubs and it is just one-way call(no need for client to wait for response), i didn&#39;t find any api in cxf for my requirement. where as in axis2 there is findandforget() method, which does the same job<br/>
<br/>
it would be great help if some one can help me out ! Thanks.
  </td>
