                <tr id="issuerow12696008" rel="12696008" data-issuekey="CXF-5572" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5572" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5572">CXF-5572</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                EHCacheManagerHolder returning wrong CacheConfiguration
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freddy Exposito
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freddy Exposito
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Feb/14 16:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:51 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Feb/14 17:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.13,                     2.7.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.11,                     2.6.14,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi All,<br/>
EHCacheManagerHolder.getCacheConfiguration() is returning wrong CacheManager. For example, in the key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.ws.security.tokenstore.TokenStore-903593607&quot; it will try to look for existing &#39;org.apache.cxf.ws.security.tokenstore.TokenStor&#39; due to the index used. <br/>
This is making CXF to use the default ehcache configuration instead of the expected specific one for &#39;org.apache.cxf.ws.security.tokenstore.TokenStore&#39; in the cxf-ehcache.xml config file.<br/>
<br/>
Besides, as the hash code part of the key can have a dash at the beginning (Ex: &quot;org.apache.cxf.ws.security.tokenstore.TokenStore--903593607&quot;) indexOf should be used instead of lastIndexOf .<br/>
I am attaching a patch.<br/>
<br/>
Thank,<br/>
Freddy
  </td>
