                <tr id="issuerow12696918" rel="12696918" data-issuekey="CXF-5577" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5577" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5577">CXF-5577</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WebApplicationException thrown when matrix parameters used with a path that ends with &quot;/&quot;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Terence Kent
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Terence Kent
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Feb/14 13:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Mar/14 12:32 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.13,                     2.7.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      (This issue was originally posted as a question to users@cxf.apache.org here: http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/JAX-RS-issue-in-2-6-13-w-JSESSIONID-as-a-path-parameter-td5740381.html)<br/>
<br/>
Including a JSESSIONID path parameter will break REST paths which end with a forward slash. For example, the path:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;proto&gt;://&lt;host:port&gt;/api/people/;jsessionid=xxx<br/>
<br/>
Will result in a WebApplicationException being thrown. If the path does not end with a forward slash, everything works as expected.
  </td>
