                <tr id="issuerow12702125" rel="12702125" data-issuekey="CXF-5622" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5622" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5622">CXF-5622</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Wrong WSS4J version number in 2.7.11-SNAPSHOT feature file
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Golovnya
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Golovnya
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Mar/14 12:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/May/14 18:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There is a collision in opensaml version number between CXF-2.7.10 and CXF-2.7.11-SNAPSHOT.<br/>
<br/>
=== cut of apache-cxf-2.7.10-features.xml ===<br/>
&lt;feature name=&quot;wss4j&quot; version=&quot;1.6.14&quot; resolver=&#39;(obr)&#39;&gt;<br/>
  ... org.apache.servicemix.bundles.opensaml/2.5.3_3 ...<br/>
&lt;/feature&gt;<br/>
=== end of cut ===<br/>
<br/>
=== cut of apache-cxf-2.7.11-SNAPSHOT-features.xml ===<br/>
&lt;feature name=&quot;wss4j&quot; version=&quot;1.6.14&quot; resolver=&#39;(obr)&#39;&gt;<br/>
  ... org.apache.servicemix.bundles.opensaml/2.6.1_1 ...<br/>
&lt;/feature&gt;<br/>
=== end of cut ===<br/>
<br/>
As you can see, the same feature (wss4j/1.6.14) refers to the different versions of org.apache.servicemix.bundles.opensaml.<br/>
<br/>
This bug leads to the wrong selection of opensaml version in features-maven-plugin, and to a non-working target container as a result.
  </td>
