                <tr id="issuerow12702363" rel="12702363" data-issuekey="CXF-5624" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5624" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5624">CXF-5624</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Wadl-first to generate method with @QueryParam(&quot;&quot;) annotation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Vjacheslav Borisov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Vjacheslav Borisov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Mar/14 12:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Mar/14 05:13 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently it is not possible to generate method with @QueryParam(&quot;&quot;) annotation using cxf-wadl2java-plugin <br/>
If I write<br/>
                    &lt;request&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;param name=&quot;req&quot; type=&quot;doc:DocumentListRequest&quot; style=&quot;query&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/request&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Then I get<br/>
DocumentListRequest list(@QueryParam(&quot;req&quot;) DocumentListRequest req);<br/>
<br/>
(&quot;req&quot; goes to both @QueryParam and param name)<br/>
<br/>
When I write WADL without  name=&quot;req&quot; or with empty name=&quot;&quot;<br/>
 &lt;request&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;param name=&quot;&quot; type=&quot;doc:DocumentListRequest&quot; style=&quot;query&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/request&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
I got syntax error (no @QueryParam  annotation and no param name)<br/>
DocumentListRequest list( DocumentListRequest );<br/>
<br/>
Could be last example (with empty name attribute or even without it) used to generate something like<br/>
<br/>
DocumentListRequest list(@QueryParam(&quot;&quot;) DocumentListRequest ocumentListRequest);<br/>
<br/>
example wadl  and maven project<br/>
https://github.com/bystrobank/testapachecxf/blob/master/src/main/webapp/schemas/testappjava/testappjava.wadl<br/>

  </td>
