                <tr id="issuerow12702641" rel="12702641" data-issuekey="CXF-5630" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5630" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5630">CXF-5630</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                In robust one-way fault the fault message should result in SOAPFaultException
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Grzegorz Grzybek
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Grzegorz Grzybek
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Mar/14 14:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Mar/14 13:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.11,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Now in {{org.apache.cxf.transport.http.HTTPConduit.WrappedOutputStream.handleResponseInternal()}} there&#39;s just one check if the exchange is one-way without checking the &quot;robust&quot; status and if exchange is one way, any soap fault is consumed.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m not sure how this should be handled, as _robustnes_ is not defined per SOAP 1.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
