                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hey,<br/>
<br/>
I am using CXF WSDL first appraoch with which I am exposing a WSDL. This wsdl have many XSD imports in it. Also the imported XSD&#39;s have various XSD&#39;s imports.<br/>
<br/>
Now when I try to generate client from file system it works fine without giving any errors or warnings. <br/>
But when I expose the same WSDL using CXF 2.7.5 JAX-WS endpoint and try generating client from exposed WSDL url from server, it start giving validating errors in imported XSD.<br/>
<br/>
I tried various methods by failed to resolve this. <br/>
Can you please help me in this.
  </td>
