                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      currently it&#39;s only be &quot;binary&quot; on the server side, which in turn will create jms ObjectMessage, however for some special client(not the jms client) may use raw api which don&#39;t understand the jms_object message, so we should enable &quot;byte&quot; as well.
