<br/>
We are unable to provide a test-case since the problem is indeterministic. Roughly 10-20 out of ~14000 requests a day end this way.<br/>
<br/>
We will probably apply a workaround by catching the exception and retrying the request, however CXF&#39;s behavior in this case doesn&#39;t seem to be valid.
