</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5677                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have an operation with no arguments, only an implicit header with direction {{IN}}. Calling the operation fails:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
javax.xml.ws.soap.SOAPFaultException: wrong number of arguments while invoking public java.util.List sample.ImplicitHeaderWithExtSoapHeaderINSampleTest$ImplicitHeaderSampleImplementation.operationWithNoArgs(com.sample.audit.Audit) with params [com.sample.audit.Audit@c19fbf, com.sample.audit.Audit@c19fbf].<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxws.JaxWsClientProxy.invoke(JaxWsClientProxy.java:159)<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
It works for operations with non-empty parameters and when the implicit header has direction INOUT.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll attach a sample that demonstrates the issue.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks!
