                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, we have a web service operation with an empty body but with a header. The header is defined in a separate name space and xsd. The service is exposed and accessed using JAX-WS.<br/>
<br/>
When called we get an IllegalArgumentException with message, &quot;Wrong number of arguments&quot;. <br/>
<br/>
Attached is a maven project with the service definitions and a unit test reproducing the issue.<br/>
<br/>
The stack trace is as follows:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
