                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The current documentation of Open Data Protocol (Apache olingo) lack some Spring / XML example in chapter: http://cxf.apache.org/docs/jax-rs-search.html#JAX-RSSearch-OpenDataProtocol<br/>
Especially the line:<br/>
??...as shown in this test, see the startServers function...??<br/>
<br/>
(Not so obvious) Example for a SearchBean ;)<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;cxf:bus&gt;<br/>
  &lt;cxf:properties&gt;<br/>
    &lt;entry key=&quot;search.query.parameter.name&quot; value=&quot;$filter&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;entry key=&quot;search.parser&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.ext.search.odata.ODataParser&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;constructor-arg value=&quot;#{ T(org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.ext.search.SearchBean) }&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/entry&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/cxf:properties&gt;<br/>
&lt;/cxf:bus&gt;<br/>
{code}
  </td>
