                <tr id="issuerow12707886" rel="12707886" data-issuekey="CXF-5683" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5683" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5683">CXF-5683</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Memory Leak in org.apache.cxf.transport.http.osgi.HTTPTransportActivator
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Isaac Graf
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Isaac Graf
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Apr/14 06:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/Mar/17 18:32 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      linux Redhat 5.3 (64 bit) Intel processor<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Our client makes JAXWS calls to the server using IBM Websphere Liberty 8.5.5.1, which uses cxf 2.6.2 for JAXWS implementation. Every 3 seconds it makes a heartbeat check to the server. We found that over time the memory is growing in our client and heap dump analysis showed that the issue is org.apache.cxf.transport.http.osgi.HTTPTransportActivator$PidInfo.<br/>
<br/>
After about 10 days of running there were 448,225 instances of this PidInfo class using 84 MB of memory. A day later, there were 492,085 instances of PidInfo using 93 MB of memory.
  </td>
