                <tr id="issuerow12709059" rel="12709059" data-issuekey="CXF-5699" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5699" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5699">CXF-5699</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                IdleStateHandler cannot be shared across the channel
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Apr/14 14:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Apr/14 14:52 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.0-milestone1,                     3.0.0-milestone2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I got this exception when I try to run some performance tests on cxf-rt-transport-http-netty-server.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
WARNING: Failed to initialize a channel. Closing: [id: 0x5d5c0987, /127.0.0.1:63183 =&gt; /127.0.0.1:9090]<br/>
io.netty.channel.ChannelPipelineException: io.netty.handler.timeout.IdleStateHandler is not a @Sharable handler, so can&#39;t be added or removed multiple times.<br/>
	at io.netty.channel.DefaultChannelPipeline.checkMultiplicity(DefaultChannelPipeline.java:461)<br/>
	at io.netty.channel.DefaultChannelPipeline.addLast0(DefaultChannelPipeline.java:138)<br/>
	at io.netty.channel.DefaultChannelPipeline.addLast(DefaultChannelPipeline.java:131)<br/>
