                <tr id="issuerow12710735" rel="12710735" data-issuekey="CXF-5713" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5713" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5713">CXF-5713</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                FIQL: the % character is not taken into account in FIQL expression
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Romain Castan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Romain Castan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Apr/14 21:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/14 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Apr/14 12:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0,                     2.7.12            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">14400</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">14400</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5721                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When there is the character &#39;%&#39; in the expression FIQL the JPA query is not valid.<br/>
Currently, for this following expression FIQL:<br/>
_s=name==apache%software*<br/>
the generated SQL query is:<br/>
... where name like &#39;apache%software%&#39;<br/>
while the generated SQL query should be:<br/>
... where name like &#39;apache\%sofware%&#39; escape &#39;\&#39; 
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate">14400</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate">14400</td>
                                            <td class="labels">    patch</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060">    Moderate
</td>
