</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                org.apache.cxf.interceptor.LoggingMessage doesn&#39;t have getId() property
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
