                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      No replace &#39;*&#39; character by &#39;%&#39; character in the SQL query, when this one is located in the middle expression.<br/>
example:<br/>
street==Str*t*<br/>
Currently the SQL is:<br/>
... where street LIKE &#39;Str*t%&#39;<br/>
While the SQL should be:<br/>
... where street LIKE &#39;Str%t%&#39;
