                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There are a few instance of code like:<br/>
<br/>
            try {<br/>
                //empty out the cache<br/>
                cos.lockOutputStream();<br/>
                cos.resetOut(null, false);<br/>
            } catch (Exception ex) {<br/>
                //ignore<br/>
            }<br/>
in LoggingOutInterceptor.java which are bad coding practice... code like this will hide issues which every sensible developer would not want to ignore...
  </td>
