                <tr id="issuerow12715152" rel="12715152" data-issuekey="CXF-5748" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5748" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5748">CXF-5748</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Improve WS-Security Kerberos configuration
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/May/14 11:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/May/14 13:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
Configuring Kerberos with WS-Security is currently a bit more cumbersome than it needs to be on the client side. The user must create a KerberosClient Object, set the JAAS Context + service name / CallbackHandler on it, and set it as a JAX-WS property.<br/>
<br/>
For Spnego on the other hand, we can simply use the &quot;ws-security.kerberos.jaas.context&quot;, &quot;ws-security.kerberos.spn&quot; and standard &quot;ws-security.callback-handler&quot; properties. This task is to allow this when working with Kerberos as well.
  </td>
