                                            <td class="description">      We are using CXF with Async HTTP Transport to call web services of another system (about 15000 requests per day). Some messages sent each day end in SocketTimeoutException. About 15-30 out of them cause connection leak (logs provided below).<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
