</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5766" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5766">CXF-5766</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Caching nonces to disk may not work if the service QName is too long
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
