                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
This task is to allow the STSClient to fallback to call &quot;Issue&quot; if &quot;Renew&quot; fails. Some STS instances do not support the renew binding. This behaviour will be controlled by a JAX-WS boolean &quot;ws-security.issue.after.failed.renew&quot; defaulting to &quot;true&quot;.
