                <tr id="issuerow12716998" rel="12716998" data-issuekey="CXF-5771" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5771" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5771">CXF-5771</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Limitation of handling bean params inside ClientProxyImpl
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michał P
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michał P
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/May/14 08:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Jun/15 11:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Method ClientProxyImpl#getValuesFromBeanParam is limited only to use getters/setters, Annotations placed on fields are ignored.<br/>
<br/>
Works:<br/>
<br/>
public class Bean {<br/>
  private String value;<br/>
  <br/>
  @HeaderParam(&quot;X-VALUE&quot;)<br/>
  public void setValue(String value) { this.value = value; }<br/>
  public String getValue() { return value; }<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
Doesn&#39;t work:<br/>
<br/>
public class Bean {<br/>
  @HeaderParam(&quot;X-VALUE&quot;)<br/>
  private String value;<br/>
  // getters/setters<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Resolution would be to search for annotations also on fields not only methods.
  </td>
