                <tr id="issuerow12717020" rel="12717020" data-issuekey="CXF-5772" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5772" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5772">CXF-5772</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF codegen plugin: Expose original wsdl through wsdlLocation generates a duplicate option exception
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ariel C
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ariel C
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/May/14 10:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Apr/17 19:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Apr/17 15:44 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to expose the original WSDL in a service generated by Maven cxf-codegen-plugin.<br/>
<br/>
Even when I follow the documentation examples, I&#39;m getting an org.apache.cxf.tools.common.toolspec.parser.BadUsageException: Duplicated option: wsdlLocation<br/>
<br/>
My CXF version is 2.7.11 and this is a copy of my Maven configuration:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
    &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;version&gt;2.7.11&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
    &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
        &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
            &lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
            &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
            &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
            &lt;wsdlRoot&gt;${basedir}/src/main/wsdl&lt;/wsdlRoot&gt;<br/>
            &lt;includes&gt;<br/>
                &lt;include&gt;*.wsdl&lt;/include&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/includes&gt;<br/>
            &lt;excludes&gt;<br/>
                &lt;exclude&gt;*MySpecialService.wsdl&lt;/exclude&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/excludes&gt;<br/>
            &lt;wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
                &lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;wsdl&gt;src/main/wsdl/MySpecialService.wsdl&lt;/wsdl&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;wsdlLocation&gt;classpath:/wsdl/MySpecialService.wsdl&lt;/wsdlLocation&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
            &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
                &lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
&lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
I&#39;ve tried by removing includes/excludes options (necessaries because there is just one WSDL that I need to expose the original WSDL) with same exception result. Also, by putting wsdlLocation as an extraarg. Always the &quot;duplicated wsdlLocation&quot; error.
