                <tr id="issuerow12718300" rel="12718300" data-issuekey="CXF-5782" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5782" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5782">CXF-5782</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Lower logging level of generated class names
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tom Dunstan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tom Dunstan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Jun/14 04:23 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Apr/17 19:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Mar/17 20:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.11,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JAXBUtils.logGeneratedClassNames logs out generated class names at INFO level. This means that when using the dynamic client factory, the entire process can be run smoothly and I won&#39;t see any output at all (as expected), except for the generated classes.<br/>
<br/>
This should really be at DEBUG level, at least when called from the DynamicClientFactory where the caller is generating them on the fly. Maybe the level could be passed in to JAXBUtils.logGeneratedClassNames.
  </td>
