                <tr id="issuerow12718357" rel="12718357" data-issuekey="CXF-5783" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5783" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5783">CXF-5783</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Port getter method not renamed in the generated Service class
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sandor Racz
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sandor Racz
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Jun/14 10:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Jun/14 16:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     2.6.14            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.15,                     2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have the following WSDL service definition:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
...<br/>
&lt;wsdl:service name=&quot;SOAPService&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsdl:port name=&quot;SoapPort&quot; binding=&quot;tns:Greeter_SOAPBinding&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soap:address location=&quot;http://localhost:8080&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsdl:port&gt;<br/>
&lt;/wsdl:service&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
During the class generation (using apache maven cxf plugin) I want to change the port getter method with this custom binding code fragment:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
...<br/>
&lt;jaxws:bindings node=&quot;wsdl:definitions/wsdl:service[@name=&#39;SOAPService&#39;]/wsdl:port[@name=&#39;SoapPort&#39;]&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;jaxws:method name=&quot;getMyCustomPort&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:bindings&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
But in the generated code the method name does not change, the default  {{getSoapPort()}} remains.
  </td>
