                                            <td class="environment">      TomEE 1.6.0, Java 1.7, CXF 2.7.3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, <br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m currenlty trying to deploy 2 applications in a TomEE. (2 WAR files)<br/>
In the frist one I deploy a webservice, in the second one I create a cxf client, using the generated stub from cxf-codegen-plugin.<br/>
<br/>
Deployment of webservice works fine, but when creating the clientduring the deployment of the second application I get the following error:<br/>
{code}<br/>
Caused by: javax.xml.ws.WebServiceException: org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ServiceConstructionException: Service class gcs.information.service.GCSInformationServiceInterface does not implement<br/>
        at org.apache.cxf.jaxws.ServiceImpl.getPort(ServiceImpl.java:334)<br/>
