{code}<br/>
<br/>
But when I deploy only the second application with the client, the creation is ok, but we want to be able to deploye both applications in the same server.<br/>
<br/>
After googling the issue I found some blogs saying cxf version mix can cause this issue, I already replaced the cxf libs in TomEE with 2.7.3, but issue is still there.<br/>
<br/>
Hope that someone can help me, because this issue is blocking for us currently.<br/>
<br/>
Best regards, <br/>
<br/>
Olivier<br/>

