                <tr id="issuerow12724933" rel="12724933" data-issuekey="CXF-5841" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5841" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5841">CXF-5841</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PolicyReferences when using annotations and no separate Java Interface
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Bartosz Baranowski
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Bartosz Baranowski
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Jul/14 10:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Jul/14 16:33 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is offspring of CXF-4816 ( cause, since it brought impl processing ) and CXF-5665.<br/>
If there is a &#39;placement&#39; attribute present in Policy - regardless of it being a standalone declaration in service implementation or part of @Policies group, there will be duplicate declaration of policy reference. Attached is patch with testcase mod to show problem.<br/>
<br/>
3.x is possibly affected as well.<br/>
<br/>
NOTE: I cant assign 3.x and component since JIRA throws &quot;Does not exist&quot;
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
