</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I set the attachment-max-size option for my endpoint, a CacheSizeExceededException is thrown if the attachment size exceeds the configured value. <br/>
In this case the attachment tempfile is not deleted by the CXF runtime, when I close the AttachmentDataSource InputStream. <br/>
<br/>
Analyzing the issue I noticed that 2 tempfiles are created (I have only 1 attachment), 2 AttachmentDataSource&#39;s can be retreived, but closing both of them deletes only one of the tempfiles.
