                <tr id="issuerow12725301" rel="12725301" data-issuekey="CXF-5845" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5845" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5845">CXF-5845</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                HTTPTransportActivator does not clean up old configuration while updating
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Łukasz Dywicki
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Łukasz Dywicki
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Jul/14 16:03 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Jul/14 09:53 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.7,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      ConfigAdminHttpConduitConfigurer does not clean up configuration for old URLs.<br/>
<br/>
Steps to reproduce:<br/>
1. Create new configuration<br/>
2. Specify detailed URI, eg. http://localhost:8040/services/test/bar.*<br/>
3. Verify if conduit works<br/>
4. Update URI to http://localhost:8040/services/test.*<br/>
<br/>
Both entries will be present in conduit configurer.
