                <tr id="issuerow12725584" rel="12725584" data-issuekey="CXF-5852" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5852" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5852">CXF-5852</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                _wadl creates a Document for json MediaType and supposes jettison is used behind, please allow to use another mapper
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Romain Manni-Bucau
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Romain Manni-Bucau
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Jul/14 19:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Mar/17 15:56 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi<br/>
<br/>
in WadlGenerator if the query type is json then a Document is returned. Jettison is able to map it but if you replace providers (jackson, fleece, ...) it doesn&#39;t work.<br/>
<br/>
The idea is to get rid of this and return an object model of the wadl, this way any provider can map it.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
