                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Since CXF-4495 (contained in CXF 2.6.3), anonymous users are denied to call unprotected methods.<br/>
The method &quot;handleMessage&quot; of the class &quot;AbstractAuthorizingInInterceptor&quot; now checks that the UserPrincipal is not null.<br/>
Any call results now into a AccessDeniedException.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
Caused by: org.apache.cxf.interceptor.security.AccessDeniedException: Unauthorized<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.security.AbstractAuthorizingInInterceptor.handleMessage(AbstractAuthorizingInInterceptor.java:57) ~[cxf-rt-core-2.6.3.jar:2.6.3]<br/>
{code}<br/>

