</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi guys,<br/>
<br/>
In Apache Karaf Cellar, I started to implement new features on the HTTP service (load balancing, session replication).<br/>
<br/>
I started a POC on implementing a STS tokens store using Hazelcast.<br/>
<br/>
I means that it would be possible to have multiple STS server running on Cellar, with distributed tokens. So the token generated on one STS will be available for another STS in the cluster.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m moving forward on this feature (I will share my github fork as soon as it&#39;s &quot;operational&quot;).<br/>
<br/>
Thoughts ?
  </td>
