                <tr id="issuerow12726830" rel="12726830" data-issuekey="CXF-5872" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5872" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5872">CXF-5872</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAXB Dispatch clients try to create a JAX-WS exception and NPE
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Jul/14 16:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Jul/14 19:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.15,                     2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
JAX-WS Dispatch clients using a JAXB Context will use the context to parse returned faults into a JAXB object.  However, the next step in the ClientFaultConverter is to try and create an Exception object that is throwable from that.  Since Dispatch objects don&#39;t have the generated exceptions, this results in a null class and the cls.getConstructor calls will NPE.   Should just allow the default SOAPFaultException for dispatch clients.
  </td>
