                <tr id="issuerow12726831" rel="12726831" data-issuekey="CXF-5873" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5873" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5873">CXF-5873</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Exception in SoapOutInterceptor causes lots of warnings in log
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Jul/14 16:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Jul/14 19:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.6.15,                     2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
If a client doesn&#39;t read the entire message (maybe a fault is detected early) and closes the connection before the SoapOutInterceptor manages to write the body close/envelope close, a SOAPFault is thrown and then a whole series of log entries occurs from the original Fault, then a new fault due to trying to write out a new root (the SOAP:Fault element), etc...  <br/>
<br/>
We should detect if the cause is an EOFException and just ignore/continue as there is nothing we can do.
  </td>
