                <tr id="issuerow12726846" rel="12726846" data-issuekey="CXF-5874" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5874" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5874">CXF-5874</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add ability to strictly enforce WSA Action values
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Jul/14 18:03 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Jul/14 19:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
We currently use the WSA Action to select an operation, but if an operation cannot be found, we continue and use the body contents to determine the operation.   We don&#39;t re-check the Action or anything afterwords.   <br/>
<br/>
It would be good to (optionally) throw an fault if the actions then don&#39;t match.
  </td>
