                <tr id="issuerow12727914" rel="12727914" data-issuekey="CXF-5887" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5887" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5887">CXF-5887</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Enum issue for REST requests
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Vinay Kumar
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Vinay Kumar
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jul/14 12:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Mar/15 18:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Jul/14 15:56 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5722,                                                CXF-6287                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      CXF Version: 2.7.4<br/>
JDK - build 1.7.0_40-b43
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am not sure weather its bug or I am doing something wrong. Basically I am creating REST API with Enum as one of the QueryParam. The Enum class is generated from xsd :<br/>
<br/>
Enum in xsd:<br/>
&lt;xsd:simpleType name=&quot;CodeEnum&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;xsd:restriction base=&quot;xsd:string&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;xsd:enumeration value=&quot;One&quot; /&gt;<br/>
			&lt;xsd:enumeration value=&quot;Two&quot; /&gt;<br/>
			&lt;xsd:enumeration value=&quot;Hello World&quot; /&gt;			<br/>
		&lt;/xsd:restriction&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/xsd:simpleType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Jaxb class for Enum has variables ONE(&quot;One&quot;), TWO(&quot;Two&quot;), HELLO_WORLD(&quot;Hello World&quot;)<br/>
<br/>
REST API: getCode(@QueryParam(&quot;code&quot;) CodeEnum code);<br/>
<br/>
CXF Generated WADL content for API is : <br/>
<br/>
&lt;resource path=&quot;getCode&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;method name=&quot;GET&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;request&gt;<br/>
&lt;param name=&quot;code&quot; style=&quot;query&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;option value=&quot;ONE&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;option value=&quot;TWO&quot;/&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;HELLO_WORLD&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/param&gt;&lt;/request&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Here What I observed in wadl is options values are Enum names I would expect Enum values..<br/>
<br/>
If above wadl option is selected . CXF server throws IllegalArgumentException since it could not find ONE.<br/>
<br/>
Is it bug or is there any work around to solve this issue<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in advance.
  </td>
