                <tr id="issuerow12727954" rel="12727954" data-issuekey="CXF-5888" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5888" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5888">CXF-5888</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Unwrapped operation detection not looking for attributes of extended types
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jul/14 15:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Jul/14 16:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.13,                     3.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
If an operation points an a complexType, the unwrapping logic does check if the type has an attribute and will keep the operation as &quot;bare&quot; if there is an attribute.  However, if the complexType is an extension of another complexType that contains attributes, those attributes are not examined and thus the operation may be &quot;unwrapped&quot;, but those attributes are then lost.<br/>
<br/>
Per spec, the operation should remain in bare mode for this case.
  </td>
