                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using a policy as follows:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;wsp:Policy xmlns:wsu=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd&quot; wsu:Id=&quot;SecurityServiceSignThenEncryptPolicy&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsp:ExactlyOne&gt;<br/>
      &lt;wsp:All&gt;<br/>
        &lt;sp:AsymmetricBinding xmlns:sp=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/07/securitypolicy&quot;&gt;<br/>
          &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
            &lt;sp:InitiatorToken&gt;<br/>
              &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sp:X509Token sp:IncludeToken=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/07/securitypolicy/IncludeToken/Always&quot;&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;sp:WssX509V1Token11/&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/sp:X509Token&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/sp:InitiatorToken&gt;<br/>
            &lt;sp:RecipientToken&gt;<br/>
              &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sp:X509Token sp:IncludeToken=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/07/securitypolicy/IncludeToken/Always&quot;&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;sp:WssX509V1Token11/&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/sp:X509Token&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/sp:RecipientToken&gt;<br/>
            &lt;sp:AlgorithmSuite&gt;<br/>
              &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sp:TripleDes/&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/sp:AlgorithmSuite&gt;<br/>
            &lt;sp:Layout&gt;<br/>
              &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
                &lt;sp:Lax/&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/sp:Layout&gt;<br/>
            &lt;!-- &lt;sp:IncludeTimestamp/&gt; --&gt;<br/>
            &lt;!-- &lt;sp:EncryptSignature/&gt; --&gt;<br/>
            &lt;sp:OnlySignEntireHeadersAndBody/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;!-- &lt;sp:SignBeforeEncrypting/&gt; --&gt;<br/>
            &lt;!-- &lt;sp:EncryptBeforeSigning/&gt; --&gt;<br/>
          &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/sp:AsymmetricBinding&gt;<br/>
        &lt;sp:SignedParts xmlns:sp=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/07/securitypolicy&quot;&gt;<br/>
          &lt;sp:Body/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/sp:SignedParts&gt;<br/>
        &lt;sp:EncryptedParts xmlns:sp=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/07/securitypolicy&quot;&gt;<br/>
          &lt;sp:Body/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/sp:EncryptedParts&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/wsp:All&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsp:ExactlyOne&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
a message like this is generated<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
