                <tr id="issuerow12729700" rel="12729700" data-issuekey="CXF-5905" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5905" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5905">CXF-5905</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Allow setting additional Security Provider at Exchange level
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Jul/14 10:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Jul/14 07:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.2,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        WSS-507                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is a follow-up from the CXF dev list thread at http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/On-BouncyCastle-installed-as-a-global-security-provider-td5746785.html and is meant to work with the WSS4J changes at https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/WSS-507 .<br/>
CXF could allow setting a custom (BouncyCastle) security provider in the message exchange; if provided, that would be set into WSS4J ThreadLocalSecurityProvider (when installed) just before running sensible interceptors, and cleaned up just afterwards.<br/>
Attached is an initial patch; I&#39;m going to figure out the other WS-Security interceptors that need to be modified if this approach is fine.
  </td>
