                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In case of claim mapping in a federation scenario the {{org.apache.cxf.sts.claims.ClaimManager}} parses the onBehalfOf token to detected source claims. The method parseClaimsInAssertion for SAML 1 &amp; 2 token contains a bug by only copying the first claim value. <br/>
This error becomes visible for example for role claims with multliple values.
