                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When programming a CXF WS client:<br/>
org.apache.cxf.binding.soap.SoapFault class&#39;s lang property is set correctly from the SOAP fault (from the xml:lang attribute), in case of SOAP 1.2 faults.<br/>
However, in case of SOAP 1.1 faults, the SoapFault class&#39;s lang attribute is not set (NULL), even if the SOAP fault&#39;s xml:lang attribute is set.
