                                            <td class="environment">      Apache Tomcat 7.0.52 on CentOS Linux
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m using  org.apache.cxf.sts.event.map.MapEventLogger (from CXF 2.7.13-SNAPSHOT) to support auditing in my STS. I don&#39;t want it to log stack traces in the audit log, so I&#39;ve set the property logStacktrace to false in my CXF bean config. But I&#39;m getting stack traces anyway. It appears that the logStacktrace property check has not been implemented.
  </td>
