</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5915" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5915">CXF-5915</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAX-WS Dispatch sending JAXBSource with attachment
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Zsolt Szloboda
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Zsolt Szloboda
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Jul/14 00:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Mar/17 15:34 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-5832                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am trying to send a JAXBSource payload from a JAX-WS Dispatch; <br/>
the JAXBSource&#39;s Marshaller has a custom AttachmentMarshaller <br/>
that puts the attachments into the AttachmentCollection<br/>
the problem is that the attachments are not included in the request multipart SOAP message<br/>
however, if I transform the same JAXBSource request payload <br/>
into a DOMSource, and send this DOMSource with Dispatch#invoke() method, <br/>
then the attachments are included in the request multipart SOAP message!<br/>
I think the problem is that <br/>
when I send the JAXBSource <br/>
the attachments are added &quot;too late&quot; 
  </td>
