http://cxf.apache.org/faq.html#FAQ-AreJAX-WSclientproxiesthreadsafe?<br/>
<br/>
It refers to &quot;client proxies&quot;, but it is not clear whether it is the generated one from &quot;wsimport&quot; (or cxf-codegen-plugin) or the ones created by JaxWsProxyFactoryBean or if both are equivalent.<br/>
<br/>
In a comment in the issues CXF-3558 Willem Jiang says they are thread safe, so now I am confused.
