                <tr id="issuerow12732642" rel="12732642" data-issuekey="CXF-5933" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5933" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5933">CXF-5933</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Maven cxf-java2ws-plugin CXF Stack Overflow
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Steve Wells
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Steve Wells
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Aug/14 19:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Nov/14 04:47 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Nov/14 04:46 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.12,                     3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Apache Maven 3.1.1 (0728685237757ffbf44136acec0402957f723d9a; 2013-09-17 08:22:22-0700)<br/>
Java version: 1.7.0_51, vendor: Oracle Corporation<br/>
Default locale: en_US, platform encoding: Cp1252<br/>
OS name: &quot;windows 7&quot;, version: &quot;6.1&quot;, arch: &quot;x86&quot;, family: &quot;windows&quot;
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I have some simple code generated using WSDL2Java – it’s a web service that has a message based parameter.<br/>
<br/>
However when I then try to have Maven prepare the service from the annotated Java classes I receive stack overflow errors.  This happens even if I just reference a simple object that is derived from others rather than the message object declared in the original WSDL and it happens in both CXF 2.7.12 and 3.0.1<br/>
<br/>
I’ve attached the respective interface &amp; implementation along with the dummy / simple object.<br/>
<br/>
NOTE if the object is simple containing a single String field it works - but wen the object contains other objects, etc. it fails as below<br/>
<br/>
Following is the relevant fragment from the Maven pom and the corresponding exceptions received.<br/>
<br/>
Any suggestions are appreciated!<br/>
<br/>
Thanks,<br/>
<br/>
Steve<br/>
<br/>
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
<br/>
                                             &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
                                                 &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                                                 &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-java2ws-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                                                 &lt;version&gt;${version.cxf-codegen-plugin}&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
<br/>
                                                     &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
                                                         &lt;id&gt;process-classes-request&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
                                                         &lt;phase&gt;process-classes&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
                                                         &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
                                                            &lt;className&gt;org.westhealth.westech.ews.WestechExternalRequestService&lt;/className&gt;<br/>
&lt;!--                                                      &lt;genWsdl&gt;true&lt;/genWsdl&gt; --&gt;<br/>
                                                             &lt;verbose&gt;true&lt;/verbose&gt;<br/>
                                                                                                         &lt;quiet&gt;false&lt;/quiet&gt;<br/>
                                                         &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
                                                         &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
                                                             &lt;goal&gt;java2ws&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
                                                         &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
                                                     &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
java2ws - Apache CXF 2.7.12<br/>
<br/>
Aug 07, 2014 11:51:24 AM org.apache.cxf.service.factory.ReflectionServiceFactoryBean buildServiceFromClass<br/>
INFO: Creating Service {http://www.westhealth.org/WESTECH/v0.1}WestechExternalRequestServiceService from class org.westhealth.we<br/>
stech.ews.WestechExternalRequestService<br/>
[DEBUG]<br/>
java.lang.StackOverflowError<br/>
        at com.sun.xml.bind.v2.model.impl.TypeInfoSetImpl.getClassInfo(TypeInfoSetImpl.java:265)<br/>
        at com.sun.xml.bind.v2.model.impl.RuntimeTypeInfoSetImpl.getClassInfo(RuntimeTypeInfoSetImpl.java:86)<br/>
        at com.sun.xml.bind.v2.model.impl.RuntimeTypeInfoSetImpl.getClassInfo(RuntimeTypeInfoSetImpl.java:63)<br/>
        at com.sun.xml.bind.v2.model.impl.ModelBuilder.getClassInfo(ModelBuilder.java:224)<br/>
        at com.sun.xml.bind.v2.model.impl.RuntimeModelBuilder.getClassInfo(RuntimeModelBuilder.java:104)<br/>
