                <tr id="issuerow12732647" rel="12732647" data-issuekey="CXF-5934" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5934" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5934">CXF-5934</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make WadlGenerator more easily extensible
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Romain Manni-Bucau
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Romain Manni-Bucau
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Aug/14 19:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Aug/14 13:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.13,                     3.0.2,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Trying to extend wadl generator is a pain today (= implies duplication). Would be great to get more protected method to do it faster.<br/>
<br/>
Here some of them (well the one I hoped ;)):<br/>
<br/>
* preEndMethod: in org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.model.wadl.WadlGenerator#handleOperation before writing &lt;/method&gt;. That&#39;s basically the symmetric of org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.model.wadl.WadlGenerator#startMethodTag<br/>
* startMethodTag should be IMO protected too<br/>
* pre/post &lt;request /&gt;, &lt;response /&gt;, &lt;resource /&gt; (startResourceTag protected for pre part)<br/>
<br/>
Basically idea is to be able to add before or after playing with super:<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
public class MyWadlGenerator extends WadlGenerator {<br/>
    @Override<br/>
   protected void startResourceTag(StringBuilder sb, Class&lt;?&gt; serviceClass, String path) {<br/>
         super.startResourceTag(sb, serviceClass, path);<br/>
        sb.append(...);<br/>
   }<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Personally I desire it for resources and methods but request and response would be nice to have.<br/>
<br/>
PS: handleGrammars is nice for its pupose IMO
  </td>
