    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5974" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5974">CXF-5974</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WADLGenerator sets representation media type to application/octet-stream by default
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Aug/14 12:29 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/Aug/14 12:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.2,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If Produces or Consumes is missing or wild-card then application/octet-stream is set which is not exactly correct because if a client provides a proper HTTP Accept in such cases then the resulting Content-Type will not necessarily be set  to application/octet-stream. As such showing application/octet-stream upfront can be misleading,<br/>
<br/>
Lets use wildcard if it is wildcard and let users override it if needed 
  </td>
