                                            <td class="description">      I have a client in one domain and a JBoss Application Server providing a WebService in a different domain. Calling the WebService ends up in a UnknownHostException, because during the read of the WSDL the domain part of the servername gets lost and the pure servername is not known. I debugged threw this and add the Stacktrace of the resulting exception and two screenshots showing in which member the wrong value can be found. If I change this member in memory by eclipse, the call works. 
