</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, when using jaxrs StreamingOutput to transfer a sequence of responses from a single method invocation, the responseId that refers to the original requestId is only set in the first response (the main response) but not in the responses that are subsequently pushed over the stream.<br/>
<br/>
This patch will allow the responseId to be included in all the subsequent responses so that they can all be associated with the original request.<br/>

  </td>
