                <tr id="issuerow12739923" rel="12739923" data-issuekey="CXF-5992" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-5992" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-5992">CXF-5992</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Cannot set org.apache.cxf.stax.maxAttributeCount
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jennifer Bavar
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jennifer Bavar
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Sep/14 17:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Sep/14 11:08 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.13,                     3.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Documentation            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      RHEL 6.5<br/>
Java jdk1.7.0_67 (issue also occurrs with 1.7.0_51)<br/>
CXF 3.0.0<br/>
Spring Framework 3.2.6.RELEASE
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am setting stax properties on the cxf:bus element as follows:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;cxf:bus&gt;<br/>
        &lt;cxf:properties&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry value=&quot;false&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;key&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;util:constant static-field=&quot;org.apache.cxf.ws.security.SecurityConstants.VALIDATE_TOKEN&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/key&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/entry&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.stax.maxChildElements&quot; value=&quot;${xml.maxChildElements:50000}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.stax.maxElementDepth&quot; value=&quot;${xml.maxElementDepth:100}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.stax.maxAttributeCount&quot; value=&quot;${xml.maxAttributeCount:500}&quot; /&gt; <br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.stax.maxAttributeSize&quot; value=&quot;${xml.maxAttributeSize:64000}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.stax.maxTextLength&quot; value=&quot;${xml.maxTextLength:12000000}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.stax.maxElementCount&quot; value=&quot;${xml.maxElementCount:9000000000000000000}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.stax.maxXMLCharacters&quot; value=&quot;${xml.maxXMLCharacters:9000000000000000000}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/cxf:properties&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Service starts up correctly.  When calling any method, the following stack trace is produced:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
org.apache.cxf.interceptor.Fault: Could not create XMLStreamReader (input was of encoding UTF-8).<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.StaxInInterceptor.handleMessage(StaxInInterceptor.java:136) ~[cxf-core-3.0.0.jar:3.0.0]<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.phase.PhaseInterceptorChain.doIntercept(PhaseInterceptorChain.java:307) ~[cxf-core-3.0.0.jar:3.0.0]<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.transport.ChainInitiationObserver.onMessage(ChainInitiationObserver.java:121) [cxf-core-3.0.0.jar:3.0.0]<br/>
