                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      i started using CXF FIQL search expression. in one case my search exp looks like this _s=(name==abc,123). i want to search with the name = &quot;abc,123&quot; ie the comma char is part of the whole name. but FIQL treats it as OR expression and doesn&#39;t parse it correctly. is there any way to escape chars like , or ; in FIQL search ?
