                <tr id="issuerow12741359" rel="12741359" data-issuekey="CXF-6003" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6003" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6003">CXF-6003</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                jaxrs:server &quot;basePackages&quot; attribute doesn&#39;t initialize REST services properly
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Hesam Talebi
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Hesam Talebi
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Sep/14 21:19 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Sep/14 17:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.2,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As I see, there is a feature to let cxf detect REST services automatically through &quot;basePackages&quot; attribute of &quot;jaxrs:server&quot; tag.<br/>
it supposed to scan classpath and create beans for classes with @Path(and @Provider) annotation. the problem is Spring Autowiring doesn&#39;t work for these beans, so there is no way to initialize REST services properly.<br/>
I saw the code and think found the problem. in JAXRSServerFactoryBeanDefinitionParser if you change<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
providers.add(context.getAutowireCapableBeanFactory().createBean(clazz));<br/>
{code}<br/>
to:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
providers.add(context.getAutowireCapableBeanFactory().createBean(clazz, 2, true));<br/>
{code}<br/>
everything works fine. it simply tells spring to enable autowiring in bean creation.
  </td>
