                                            <td class="description">      Support StreamingOuput result in JAXRS client proxies. For instance:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
    PdfRestService pdfRestService = JAXRSClientFactory.create(&quot;http://localhost:8080/cxf/pdf&quot;,providers);<br/>
    StreamingOuput streamingOuput = pdfRestService.generatePdf(data);<br/>
    streamingOuput.write(new FileOutputStream(&quot;output.pdf&quot;));<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
See http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/JAXRS-Client-proxy-and-StreamingOutput-td5748764.html
