                                            <td class="description">      analysis of application memory showed more than 1miilion objects of <br/>
- sun.security.util.MemoryCache$SoftCacheEntry<br/>
- sun.security.ssl.SessionId<br/>
The objects are cached for 24hr from the cxf code that I could find.<br/>
But on adding the &lt;http-conf:tlsClientParameters disableCNCheck=&quot;true&quot; sslCacheTimeout=&quot;120&quot;&gt;, the amount of objects stored is not reducing.<br/>
<br/>
please check if the SSLSession cache will get timed out using this parameter or not.
  </td>
