                                            <td class="environment">      Jboss Server
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi <br/>
We are sending special character from request SOAP body in apache CXF service. when we are  getting soap request in receive interceptor  all special character coming as  &quot;????&quot; mark instead of character we sent.<br/>
Please let us know how we can handle special character in apache cxf service. We have already tried with UTF-8 and UTF-16 but but still face same problem. We are handling special character in our existing service<br/>
we are new to Apache cxf service therefore need help if any thing need to do handle special character request in CXF internally .<br/>
Please find below example of special character<br/>
<br/>
Одноместный<br/>
 雙人房最<br/>
Я люблю тебя<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in advance
  </td>
