                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m working with CXF-STS and I just tried to get a SAML HOK. From the client part i&#39;ve set the key type to public and I&#39;ve set ws-security.sts.token.usecert property to true.<br/>
<br/>
From the server side, it occurs a NPE in the WSS4J class : Cryptobase.class@l.323. I&#39;ve changed the DefaultSubjectProvider call at line 173 in order to give an empty collection instead of null.<br/>
<br/>
Is it a bug or am I missing something?<br/>
<br/>
Since I&#39;ve changed, I&#39;m able to retrieve my SAML Token.<br/>
<br/>
Best regards,<br/>
<br/>
Bounkong Khamphousone
