                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The STSTokenValidator is used in CXF to dispatch a token received via WS-Security to the STS for validation. This task is to also allow the STSTokenValidator to send the token via the Issue binding (using &quot;OnBehalfOf&quot;). This allows the token recipient to transform the received token into another token.
