                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The UsernameTokenInterceptor kicks in when you have a UsernameToken SupportingToken security policy with no security binding. Currently it doesn&#39;t support adding a Nonce or Created via the standard WS-SecurityPolicy expressions (although it does support validating UsernameTokens against these policies).
