                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I make no call to &#39;media&#39;, and issue a GET, I am bemused to discover<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
Content-Type: */*<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
in the header. This seems wrong; all those *&#39;s seem like they go with an accept, not a content-type, and I was trying to end up with no Content-Type at all.<br/>

