</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Given this jaxws:endpoint configuration in spring:<br/>
{code}<br/>
    &lt;osgix:cm-properties id=&quot;my-server-props&quot; persistent-id=&quot;org.myservice&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;prop key=&quot;startMonitoringService&quot;&gt;false&lt;/prop&gt;<br/>
        &lt;prop key=&quot;monitoringServiceUrl&quot;&gt;/MonitoringServiceSOAP&lt;/prop&gt;<br/>
        ......<br/>
    &lt;/osgix:cm-properties&gt;<br/>
    &lt;context:property-placeholder properties-ref=&quot;my-server-props&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;jaxws:endpoint id=&quot;monitoringservice&quot; publish=&quot;${startMonitoringService}&quot; <br/>
        implementor=&quot;#MonitoringServiceWrapper&quot;<br/>
        address=&quot;${monitoringServiceUrl}&quot;&gt;<br/>
     ......<br/>
    &lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
then the SAXParseException will be thrown when deploy this jaxws service.<br/>
{code}<br/>
11:10:20,112 | ERROR | ExtenderThread-9 | BundleApplicationContextListener   50 | 94 - org.springframework.osgi.extender - 1.2.1 | Application context refresh failed (OsgiBundleXmlApplicationContext(bundle=my-server, config=osgibundle:/META-INF/spring/*.xml))<br/>
