                <tr id="issuerow12751071" rel="12751071" data-issuekey="CXF-6066" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6066" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6066">CXF-6066</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAX-RS 2.0 Client implementation is OOM prone due to its strongly referencing WebTargets
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Oct/14 12:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Oct/14 12:44 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.3,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A single JAX-RS 2.0 WebTarget may spawn many new WebTarget instances as per the WebTarget API docs. ClientImpl strongly references all WebTarget instances so that that can be pro-actively closed when Client.close() is called. <br/>
However, reusing web targets to create new web targets may cause OOM.<br/>
This issue has been identified by Hartmut Lang <br/>
<br/>
  
  </td>
