                <tr id="issuerow12751180" rel="12751180" data-issuekey="CXF-6068" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6068" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6068">CXF-6068</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make org.apache.cxf.binding.soap.interceptor.ReadHeadersInterceptor compatible with WebSphere 7
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Wish</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jan Engehausen
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jan Engehausen
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Oct/14 18:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Oct/14 11:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.13            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.3,                     2.7.14,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      WebSphere 7, Java 1.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF 2.7.13 introduced {{org.apache.cxf.binding.soap.interceptor.ReadHeadersInterceptor$HeadersProcessor}} which is is invoking {{javax.xml.stream.XMLEventFactory.newFactory()}}<br/>
<br/>
This causes problems with WebSphere 7, as IBM seems to have supplied some older version of {{XMLEventFactory}} which lacks the method {{newFactory()}}. There is {{newInstance()}}, which would work - I don&#39;t see the difference between both methods.<br/>
<br/>
Could CXF use {{newInstance()}} to support WebSphere 7? I am currently stuck with CXF 2.7.12 because of this.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks!
  </td>
